<title>USA: Brownsville, Texas $2.185 mln won by Griffin.</title>
<headline>Brownsville, Texas $2.185 mln won by Griffin.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-02-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Griffin Kubik Stephens said it won $2.185 million of Brownsville, Texas, general obligation public improvement limited tax Series 1997, with a net interest cost of 5.20 percent.</p>
